### 用户注册
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student001",
  "password": "123456",
  "type": "student"
}

### 管理员注册
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin001",
  "password": "123456",
  "type": "admin"
}

### 用户登录
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}} 